    204          /**
    205           * Pwm handler of FVT. All required tests are performed in this handler. The FVT state machine is
    206           * performed within this handler.
    207          
    208               @startuml{MclFvt_State_Machine.png}
    209          
    210                  title MclFvt - Macroblock Functional Verification Tests - FVT state machine
    211          
    212                  [*] --> MCL_FVT_TEST_INJECT_DC_CURRENT
    213          
    214                  MCL_FVT_TEST_INJECT_DC_CURRENT : Apply controlled dc current to check current and dc bus voltage sensors
    215                  MCL_FVT_TEST_INJECT_DC_CURRENT --> MCL_FVT_TEST_SURGE_RELAY   : [No error found] AND\n[Time is over]
    216          
    217                  MCL_FVT_TEST_SURGE_RELAY : Apply current and open and close surge relay.
    218                  MCL_FVT_TEST_SURGE_RELAY --> MCL_FVT_TEST_OVERCURRENT_CIRCUIT : [No error found] AND\n[Time is over]
    219          
    220                  MCL_FVT_TEST_OVERCURRENT_CIRCUIT : Reenable surge relay and wait until it is in normal operation.
    221                  MCL_FVT_TEST_OVERCURRENT_CIRCUIT --> MCL_FVT_TEST_WAITING   : [[No error found] AND [OC detected]] OR\n[Time is over]
    222          
    223                  MCL_FVT_TEST_WAITING : Waiting for Class B to be finish its checks,\ne.g. perform plausibility check.
    224                  MCL_FVT_TEST_WAITING --> MCL_FVT_TEST_FINISHED               : [No error found] AND\n[Time is over]
    225          
    226                  MCL_FVT_TEST_FINISHED : After finishing all steps, stays here until feedback is read
    227          
    228              @enduml
    229           *
    230           */

